        "title": "fix(model-selection): warn on duplicate model aliases",
        "body": "Related: #98962\n\n## What Problem This Solves\nDuplicate model aliases silently overwrite each other (last Object.entries wins).\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\nKeep first match + log warning with both conflicting targets.\n\n## User Impact\nOperators see warning instead of unpredictable last-wins behavior.\n\n## Evidence\n![proof](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhangLei99586/openclaw/proof-screenshots/pr-all-6-proof.png)\n\n- Source: `Duplicate model alias` warning + first-match in `findModelAliasCandidate`\n- `findModelAliasCandidate` keeps first match, warns with both conflicting targets at runtime\n- `resolveConfiguredModelRef` available and functional",
